      <title>工作太閒反而毀掉一個人？ ──下班有約系列文</title>
      <link>https://deanlin.net/blog/202311/when-work-is-too-easy/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 16 Nov 2023 22:52:25 +0800</pubDate>
      <guid>https://deanlin.net/blog/202311/when-work-is-too-easy/</guid>
